# Pipeline Standards
- Before pushing, ensure `npm run build` passes.
- Fix missing dependencies immediately.

## Examples
### ✅ Good
"I found a missing dependency 'lucide-react' in client/package.json. Installing it now before fixing the component."

### ❌ Bad
"The build failed. I will ignore it and just change the UI code."